          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>If you aren't using your arms, you're missing half the workout. Try to use the moving handles two days a week for an upper body workout; then use the other days to hold the stationary handles. Focus on arms for 1 minute, then pump your legs for 4. Repeat this at intervals through your workout.</p>",
